'''Unity’s collective organizes a functioning society and improves conditions while commandeering the people who perform its activity. The best-guess material reading is a coordinated provision order assisted by advanced technology, not automatic production proven merely by a hive mind. Guarantees are moderately favorable within the functioning collective, with a wide interval for dependence and coercion. The participants’ work does not disappear because a single mind coordinates it.

Control belongs near concentrated biological collective authority. Unity is not automatically an external AI, and the residents’ loss of individual choice matters even when output is shared. The low nonworking estimate retains useful production, administration, care and maintenance performed through assimilated bodies. It does not count every apparent individual as an independent decision-maker while simultaneously treating their activity as free machine output. The record describes the existing order before departure, and its later breakdown is not silently called a secure post-work continuation. All population participation remains an editorial proxy estimate.''',
